      55.77,
      398.17,
      546.92,
      481.24
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 25A of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Lakshman Kiriella, theMinister of Higher Education and Highways, having obtained a report under Section 70C of the aforesaid Act, in respectof the Nagananda International Institute for Buddhist Studies (pvt) Ltd. a company incorporated in Sri Lanka under theCompanies Act, No. 7 of 2007 and bearing registration number PV 94125, do by this Order, recognize the NaganandaInternational Institute for Buddhist Studies (pvt) Ltd. as a Degree Awarding Institute for the purpose of developing HigherEducation therein, leading to the award of the Degrees specified in Column I of the Schedule hereto, of which theabbreviations are specified in the corresponding entries in Column II of the Schedule hereto.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
